Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 克里斯托弗 你看得到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Christopher, can you see anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.20,0:00:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莎伦！- 她在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sharon! - She's there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等妈妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.50,0:01:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.30,0:01:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！宝贝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon! Honey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.10,0:02:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.70,0:02:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 家！家！- 我们这就回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Home! Home! - We're going home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,寂静岭！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silent Hill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 寂静岭！- 罗斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Silent Hill! - Rose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快醒醒 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wake up. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.10,0:02:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事了 宝贝 有我们在 - 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay, sweetie. We're here now. - It's okay. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.90,0:02:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝乖 我们这就回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, baby. We're going right home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该怎么办？- 会挺过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are we gonna do? - We'll get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有办法 一定有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find a way through this. We'll find a way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她又说了那个地方 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She said it again. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.60,0:02:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事了 宝贝 - 没事了 爸爸妈妈在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, baby. It's okay. It's okay, baby. - It's okay. We're right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.60,0:03:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.40,0:03:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:19.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,《寂静岭》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想看吗？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wanna see? - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在画什么呢 南瓜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing there, pumpkin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.60,0:03:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好一只大狮子呀 你自己画的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an amazing lion. Did you do that all by yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so impressed with you, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:04:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要做一次特别的旅行 你知道吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know we're going on a special trip, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,知不知道是要去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where we're going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.10,0:04:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.80,0:04:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 有时候你睡觉的时候 会四处走动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, sometimes when you go to sleep, you go on a little walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 还会提到一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sometimes you talk about a place…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.60,0:04:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫做寂静岭\N{\fnArial\fs30}… called Silent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.50,0:04:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.30,0:04:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's okay, sweetie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.30,0:04:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要去那里 好让你记起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're gonna go there, so you can remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸不去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy's not coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 宝贝 就我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sweetie. It's gonna be just you and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息结束了 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break's over, sweetie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡醒了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You awake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以走了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:49.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（岂不知我们要审判天使吗 岂不知圣徒要审判世界吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.40,0:05:51.40,Title,0,0,0,0,,（《新约·哥林多前书》 教会宣）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 罗斯 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Rose. What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是罗斯·达·西尔瓦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, this is Rose Da Silva.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,请留言 我稍候会回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please leave a message, and I'll call you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:21.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美国鬼城网）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.50,0:06:26.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西弗吉尼亚 寂静岭）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.60,0:06:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, Rose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.40,0:06:37.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（寂静岭 「不洁之镇」 地下火燃烧至今）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.60,0:07:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你醒啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you're awake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了好远哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,能问你个事儿 宝贝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you something, sweetie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要换你画的画？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you change your pictures?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈咪？- 不记得了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mommy? - You can't remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这个 妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't like that, Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.50,0:08:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 你不记得了？- 谁做的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Baby, you can't remember doing this? - Who did that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 没事了 - 妈咪 是谁做的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, hey, baby, it's okay. - Mommy, who did that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖 没事了 妈妈在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, honey. Mommy's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在车里等我一下好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you wait in the car for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以坐前面吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I sit in front?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然可以啦 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course you can sit in the front. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米 一份火腿加起司白面包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy, we need a ham and cheese on white.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来付油钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna pay for the gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问到寂静岭该走哪条路？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And can you tell me the best way to get to Silent Hill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在地图上找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't seem to find it on the map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.70,0:09:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么要去那？- 我 我看过一些报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why do you wanna go there? - I… I read about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,路走不通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Road don't go through no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.90,0:09:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的卡被冻结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your card was declined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.40,0:09:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 不要和陌生人说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is everything all right? - Don't talk to strangers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.40,0:09:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 多谢帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, thanks for your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要冻结我的卡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you cut off the cards?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.70,0:09:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想靠这个阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna stop me from taking her there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 听我说 我们得送莎伦去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, honey, we gotta put Sharon in a hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.20,0:09:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要专人守护 接受药物治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs constant care, and she needs medication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃药没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}The medication doesn't work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经越来越严重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's getting worse every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 领养处的人说 她来自西弗吉尼亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, the adoption people said Sharon came from West Virginia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.70,0:09:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,寂静岭也在西弗吉尼亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and Silent Hill is in West Virginia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.80,0:09:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放弃她 克里斯 决不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not giving up on her, Chris. I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底看过那些网页没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you actually read the websites, Rose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看过了 克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Chris, I read them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就相信我一次 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trust me on this, please. Just trust me on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.40,0:10:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, honey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱莎伦就像 - 我得走了 克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love Sharon every bit as much as I… - Chris, I gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像爱你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}… I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 需要帮忙吗 女士？- 没事我们很好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Need any help, ma'am? - No, we're… We're fine, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.30,0:11:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,系好安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your seatbelt fastened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.40,0:12:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 只是收音机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's just the radio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我这就关 - 妈咪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm turning it off. - Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.90,0:13:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.90,0:13:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人啊！救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:13:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.10,0:14:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿出了车祸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had an accident!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon. Honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.80,0:14:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:54.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（寂静岭欢迎您）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.90,0:15:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.20,0:16:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.80,0:16:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.20,0:18:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.50,0:19:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.80,0:19:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.50,0:19:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.00,0:19:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.20,0:20:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.70,0:20:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.50,0:20:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来救救我！妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone! Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.90,0:20:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开！滚开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me! Get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.00,0:21:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开！滚开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off! Get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.10,0:21:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！滚开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Get off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！滚开！滚开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Get off me! Get off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.80,0:21:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.40,0:23:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,寂静岭的入口 为黑暗力量所掌控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the dark one opens and closes the door to Silent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.30,0:23:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这儿是怎么回事 你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's happening. Do you know what's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.80,0:23:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找我女儿 真担心她出事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for my daughter. I'm afraid that she's been hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.80,0:23:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都失去了孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all lost our children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.50,0:23:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命从此黯淡无光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.30,0:23:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们欺骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They deceived me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.50,0:23:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,心中的罪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.40,0:23:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:24:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,令他们伤害了我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hurt my child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.30,0:24:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,虐待她\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did terrible things to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.60,0:24:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿蕾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.30,0:24:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我女儿 莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my daughter, Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.70,0:24:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有梦游症 请你小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sleepwalks, so you have to be careful…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.80,0:24:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是看到她 请让她等着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}… but if you see her, please, tell her to wait for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.40,0:24:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 她是我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, she's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.30,0:24:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我的 - 是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was mine. - It's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.70,0:24:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的 - 我的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's mine. - It's mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.70,0:24:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我的！- 放手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's mine! - Get off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.20,0:24:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在烈火中 她咽下他们的仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into the fire she swallowed their hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.10,0:25:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi there. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.40,0:25:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子 昨夜经过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, my wife, she came through here last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.20,0:25:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看见过吗？- 我女儿上夜班\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe you saw her? - Daughter worked night shift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.00,0:25:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 她是要去寂静岭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, she was heading for this place, Silent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.30,0:25:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么走？- 没路可走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do I get there? - You don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.70,0:25:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为煤矿起火 小镇被关闭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Town's closed down because of the coal fire…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.90,0:25:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下仍有余火燃烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}… still burning underground, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.60,0:25:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸几口那儿的煤烟 能要你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe enough of them fumes, oh, bound to kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.20,0:25:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.20,0:25:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哪条岔路？\N{\fnArial\fs30}… where's the turnoff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.30,0:25:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.00,0:26:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.70,0:26:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是克里斯 请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, this is Chris. Please leave a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.40,0:26:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christopher, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.10,0:26:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在寂静岭 抱歉我太莽撞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in Silent Hill. I'm sorry, I made a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.80,0:26:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦不见了 我想我知道她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon's lost, but I think I know where she is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.20,0:26:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就去学校找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}… so I'm going to the school to look for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.50,0:26:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这边不对劲 好吗？需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not okay, all right? I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.40,0:27:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 快来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.90,0:27:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,操 快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.10,0:27:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 请把手放在方向盘上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, I want you to put both hands on the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.30,0:27:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,两手放在方向盘上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put both hands on the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.00,0:27:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 小女孩哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the little girl, ma'am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.40,0:27:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 我女儿不见了 需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, my daughter, she's gone. I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.80,0:27:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下车 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of the car. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.90,0:27:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.70,0:27:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 你要干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.50,0:27:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你被捕了 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're under arrest. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.80,0:27:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所说的一切都将作为呈堂证供\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you say can and will be used against you in a court of law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.00,0:27:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没弄明白 这个地方不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you understand. There's something weird going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.80,0:27:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女儿莎伦现在十分危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter, Sharon, she's in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.70,0:27:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是真关心她 就不会踩油门逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you really cared, you wouldn't have sped off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.00,0:27:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 她病了 是梦游症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, she 's ill. She sleepwalks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.50,0:27:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点 我会找到那小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just calm right down. I'm gonna find the little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.20,0:27:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯纳特警官呼叫总部 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer Bennett to base, over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.50,0:27:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部请回话 完毕！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Base, do you copy, over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.20,0:27:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 你在流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit. - You're bleeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.50,0:28:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我翻车的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cracked my head on the road pretty good when my bike went down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.80,0:28:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,头给撞了个正着 看来是晕过去了一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have been out for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.40,0:28:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能走么？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right to walk? - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.90,0:28:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们得步行回Brahams了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it looks like we'll be hiking back to Brahams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.70,0:28:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.30,0:28:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带你回警局\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going back to the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.30,0:28:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在开玩笑吧？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you kidding? - Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.20,0:28:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可听到我说的话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you heard a single word I've said?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.10,0:28:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听到了 - 你可听进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I hear you. - Have you heard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.40,0:28:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕是一个字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}… a single word I've said?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.30,0:28:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定她就在学校 我们得回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure she's at the school, we just need to turn around…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.20,0:28:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,寂静岭 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}… Silent Hill… sorry…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.20,0:28:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦 不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}… Sharon… lost…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.00,0:28:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 我去学校找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}… think I know where… going to the school to look for her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.80,0:28:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not okay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.40,0:28:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你 你的帮助 求求你 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your… Your help. Please, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.40,0:29:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起先生 此路不通 请回吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sir, this road is closed. You'll have to turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.40,0:29:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找我妻子 她可能是走的这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for my wife. She may have come through here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.10,0:29:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她开一辆银色「吉普-自由者」 俄亥俄牌照\N{\fnArial\fs30}She drives a Jeep Liberty. Silver, Ohio plates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.30,0:29:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 那辆吉普 是这位先生的妻子在开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, this man's wife was driving the Jeep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.00,0:29:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,带过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.20,0:29:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来 - 你见过她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - You've seen her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.30,0:29:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.10,0:29:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,探长托马斯·古奇 天气不错啊 你说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inspector Thomas Gucci. Enjoying the weather, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.70,0:29:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在上帝的份上 我在找我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, I'm trying to find my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.10,0:29:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Hang on a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.50,0:29:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的那辆车 我们找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that vehicle you were talking about, we found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.10,0:29:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这座桥的尽头 里面没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's at the end of the bridge here, but it's empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.50,0:29:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何迹象表明有人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got no indication anyone's come under any harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.20,0:29:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天 - 你不介意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good Christ. - Now, you mind telling me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.00,0:29:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉我你妻子来这做什么吗 你是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}… what your wife's doing up here, Mr?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.40,0:29:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达·西尔瓦 克里斯·达·西尔瓦 - 很荣幸见到你 克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Da Silva, Chris Da Silva. - My pleasure, Chris…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.70,0:29:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上行动 就能尽快找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The faster we start looking, the faster we're gonna find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.60,0:29:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 暂且打住\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, hold your horses, hold your horses, Chris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.30,0:29:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也失踪了一名手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've also got a missing deputy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.50,0:30:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我对警官西比尔·伯纳特的了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}And knowing Officer Cybil Bennett the way I do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.80,0:30:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她应该正在寻找你的妻女\N{\fnArial\fs30}… she's probably out there looking for your wife and daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.80,0:30:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 不要让任何人通过路障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, make sure no one comes through that barricade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.30,0:30:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这就去寂静岭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get our asses up to Silent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.40,0:30:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到里面转转 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's take a look around. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.50,0:30:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让克里斯告诉我到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}While Chris here tells me what's going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.10,0:30:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是昨天起失踪的 在博拉姆斯停车加油的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}She disappeared yesterday. I spoke to her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.90,0:30:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还和我通过电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}… when she stopped for gas in Brahams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.30,0:30:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么半夜还要到这里来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why were you coming up here in the middle of the night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.90,0:30:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想帮她 - 你们这些城里人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought it would help her. - You people. You get off the highway…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.50,0:30:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着一堆麻烦事 就往乡下钻\N{\fnArial\fs30}… from whatever big city, bringing all your sick problems with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.00,0:30:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么就不听我说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't you listening to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.60,0:30:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,两年前 一个家伙来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a guy come up here two years ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.10,0:30:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,将途中拐走的男孩 扔进了一个矿井的通风口\N{\fnArial\fs30}… snatched a little boy from a rest stop, dropped him into a mine vent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.60,0:30:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决不允许这样的事情再次发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never wanna see anything like that again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.60,0:30:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你是怎么想的 但你是在帮倒忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know what you're thinking, but you're not helping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.60,0:30:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决不会伤害自己的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no way I would ever harm my own daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.00,0:30:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道她是你女儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I even know she is your daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.50,0:30:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.90,0:30:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.70,0:31:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.60,0:31:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你明白我的意思了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now do you see what I'm talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.00,0:31:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能把这手铐打开？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you take these handcuffs off me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.80,0:31:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Get walking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.40,0:31:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,托卢卡湖那头有一个火警瞭望塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a fire-lookout tower on the far side of Toluca Lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.30,0:31:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那里应该有无线电 - 臭屁警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It should have a radio. - Fuck you, you stupid cop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.60,0:31:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里完全与世隔绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is completely cut off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.30,0:31:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不知道出了什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what's going on. Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.90,0:31:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 上面这位！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you up there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.30,0:32:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是警察！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a police officer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.50,0:32:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.80,0:32:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.10,0:32:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.00,0:32:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 快打他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ, shoot it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.50,0:32:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay where you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.70,0:32:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.30,0:34:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,MIDWICH小学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Midwich Elementary School{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.10,0:34:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.80,0:34:56.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（恨恶义人的 必被定罪）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.50,0:35:20.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（教务室）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.50,0:36:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.30,0:36:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,国\N{\fnArial\fs30}COUNTRY{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.30,0:36:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,家\N{\fnArial\fs30}HOME{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.30,0:36:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,忠\N{\fnArial\fs30}LOYALTY{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.10,0:36:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,神\N{\fnArial\fs30}GOD{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.90,0:36:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,达·西尔瓦夫人 我是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Da Silva, I am an officer of the law…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.40,0:36:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带你到安全地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and I will take you to safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.50,0:36:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,达·西尔瓦夫人 我是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Da Silva, I am an officer of the law…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.50,0:36:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带你到安全地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and I will take you to safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.70,0:36:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么不让我来喊？- 像这种\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why don't you let me do that? - Ninety percent of the time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.60,0:36:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,妻子带着女儿私奔\N{\fnArial\fs30}… when a wife takes a run…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.10,0:36:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃到这种地方来\N{\fnArial\fs30}… she takes the daughter to a place like this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.60,0:36:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,八成是和她丈夫斗气\N{\fnArial\fs30}… I'd say she's damn mad at her husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.30,0:36:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很喜欢挖别人家底是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like hauling skeletons out of your family closet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.80,0:36:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不总是 不过现在 倒是可以挖挖我们车底\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not all the time, but we're driving on top of them right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.40,0:37:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下的煤矿还在燃烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coal fire's still burning underneath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.00,0:37:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那边的理发店了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see the barbershop over there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.40,0:37:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 曾经是我父亲的 - 你父亲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Used to be my father's. - Your father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.50,0:37:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.60,0:37:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,74年11月的那场大火\N{\fnArial\fs30}November '74, when the fire caught.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.20,0:37:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然人们尽了全力疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tried to evacuate this place as quick as they could…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.70,0:37:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在那地狱般的大火里 死的死 失踪的失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}… but it was hellish, people were dying and disappearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.90,0:37:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至有一半的尸体都找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, they couldn't even find half the bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.80,0:37:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,寂静岭的末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the end of Silent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.60,0:37:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是好人 大部分是\N{\fnArial\fs30}These were good people, most of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.00,0:37:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的 多多少少吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some, you might say deserved it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.50,0:37:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.00,0:37:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.50,0:39:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.20,0:39:24.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巫女）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.20,0:39:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你藏在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you hiding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.50,0:39:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死巫女！烧死巫女！烧死巫女！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn the witch! Burn the witch! Burn the witch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.30,0:39:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿蕾莎·格雷斯彼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alessa Gillespie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.40,0:39:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.10,0:41:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.90,0:41:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.20,0:41:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise I'm gonna help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.80,0:41:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯林\N{\fnArial\fs30}COLIN{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.80,0:41:53.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（- 你敢吗 - 那你呢 - 你敢我就敢）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.60,0:43:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.60,0:43:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.80,0:43:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.70,0:43:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,神啊 救救我 求你救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me. Oh, God. Please, please, help me. Help…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.50,0:43:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me. Please, help me. Help me. Help me, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.80,0:44:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's happening again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.50,0:46:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Please! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.10,0:47:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.80,0:47:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.10,0:47:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.60,0:47:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.40,0:48:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.90,0:48:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.10,0:49:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗斯！- 戴上口罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rose! - Put your mask on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.50,0:49:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯 你在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.40,0:49:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能感觉到她 - 你什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I felt her. - You what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.10,0:49:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的香水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her perfume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.80,0:49:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她来过这里 - 谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She was here. - Who was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.40,0:49:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我妻子 - 她没来过这儿 戴上口罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My wife. - She wasn't here. Put this mask on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.60,0:49:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 香水味 - 戴上口罩呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Perfume. - Breathe. Through that mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.90,0:49:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 我们走 走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go. We're gonna go this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.70,0:49:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.50,0:49:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她来过过这里 - 不 她没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She was here. - No, no, she wasn't here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.60,0:49:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有感应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.30,0:49:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.80,0:49:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续找吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's keep looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.20,0:50:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开！滚开！滚开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off! Get off! Get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.30,0:50:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那根铁管拿过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me that pipe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.10,0:50:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯 铁管！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose, the pipe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.30,0:50:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.10,0:50:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿到了 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it. I got it. - Quick, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.20,0:51:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,能逃出去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we get out of here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.60,0:51:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.80,0:51:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一匣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last mag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.40,0:51:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就剩这么点子弹了？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's all the bullets you got? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.80,0:51:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.50,0:51:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.80,0:51:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.00,0:51:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下！快蹲下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down! Stay down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.20,0:51:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.90,0:51:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.90,0:52:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.40,0:53:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.00,0:53:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.10,0:53:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.40,0:54:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看到了？那是真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw that, right? That was real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.60,0:54:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.20,0:54:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这的确很疯狂 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I know this is crazy. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.10,0:54:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要冷静 我孩子不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta calm right down, because my kid is not here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.70,0:54:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这「状况」再次发生前 得找到我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and I've gotta find her before this happens again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.40,0:54:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道从何找起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know where to start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.90,0:54:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.80,0:54:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个饭店的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from a hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.90,0:54:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道在哪 但她就在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where it is, but she is in this hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.70,0:54:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,饭店？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hotel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.10,0:54:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.90,0:54:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.90,0:54:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 放弃尝试吧 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, don't be trying anything, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.90,0:54:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们留人整夜驻守这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got men up here all night long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.20,0:54:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,会找到你的妻女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna find your wife, we're gonna find your daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.10,0:55:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让老百姓到处乱走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't have civilians wandering around on their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.70,0:55:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你隐瞒了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not telling me everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.10,0:55:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到底发生过什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What really happened up here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.60,0:55:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,往事就让它入土为安吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let it rest in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.10,0:55:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查询台 - 请找下托卢卡郡的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Directory assistance. - Toluca County Archives, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.70,0:55:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,请稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}One moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.60,0:55:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关于什么的？- 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Archives? - Yeah, listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.10,0:55:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有关于寂静岭的记录？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have the records there from Silent Hill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.90,0:55:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么记录？- 警方记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which records, sir? - The police records.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.20,0:55:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 那些记录是绝密档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sir, those records are confidential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.90,0:55:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我不能… 不 听着 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I can't… No, listen, I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.30,0:55:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我没法提供相关信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sir, I can't access that information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.70,0:55:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 该死的 - 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen, goddamn it. - Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.30,0:55:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有急事 - 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is an emergency. - I can't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.90,0:55:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.20,0:55:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说这儿闹鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They used to say this place was haunted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.50,0:55:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.20,0:56:02.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（大饭店）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.10,0:56:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.90,0:56:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 滚开 - 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay away. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.90,0:56:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开 罪人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away, sinner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.00,0:56:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.50,0:56:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.10,0:56:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,信仰是我们的掘墓人 带来灭顶之灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faith is our destroyer. Faith has brought us doom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.10,0:56:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 滚！- 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get back! - Hey, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.50,0:56:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 滚！- 住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get back! - Hey, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.70,0:56:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 这扔第一块石头的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you of thee who cast the first stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.20,0:56:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有牧羊人的羊羔 没有羊群的牧羊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lambs without a shepherd, shepherd without a flock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.30,0:56:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的罪恶将你困诸此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your sins which hold you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.60,0:56:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 少造谣了！- 冷静！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop your lies! - Calm down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.30,0:56:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, it's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.10,0:56:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不会伤害你 - 她走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not gonna hurt you. - She's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.60,0:56:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.50,0:56:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 我叫安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna. My name is Anna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.30,0:56:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 这儿到底是怎么回事？她是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on here, Anna? Who was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.50,0:56:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我见过她 - 达利亚是被赶出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've seen her before. - Dahlia was cast out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.80,0:56:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,连黑暗力量也不要她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even the darkness wants her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.10,0:57:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她也失去了女儿 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's lost her daughter too. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.90,0:57:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罪人应该断子绝孙 - 你在这里做什么 安娜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sinners deserve to lose their spawn. - What are you doing here, Anna?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.00,0:57:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲需要更多食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother needs more food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.20,0:57:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 还有其他人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean there are other people here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.90,0:57:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯贝拉保护我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christabella keeps us safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.10,0:57:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安娜 - 我们在教堂避难\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anna. - We take refuge in the church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.00,0:57:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.50,0:57:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿不见了 她一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost my daughter. She's all alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.20,0:57:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,能想象她有多害怕吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine how frightened she must feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.10,0:57:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 有没有见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, have you seen her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.20,0:57:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,知不知道她在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where she is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.40,0:57:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要是有信仰 就能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she has faith, she might survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.50,0:57:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.50,0:57:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.90,0:57:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,见过这个么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.20,0:57:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在学校见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen it at the school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.10,0:57:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的建筑上都有 老祖先修的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on all the buildings the elders of my elders built.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.00,0:58:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们团结和信仰的标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a symbol of our unity, a symbol of our faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.90,0:58:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯 看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose, look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.70,0:58:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么？- 和你的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Just like yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.30,0:58:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪找到的？- 地上到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where did you find it? - They're all over the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.00,0:58:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.00,0:58:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.40,0:58:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在几号拿的？- 111号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What number did you take this from? - 111.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.50,0:58:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去111号房\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go to room 111.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.80,1:00:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,寂静岭警方记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silent Hill Police Records{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.40,1:00:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,古奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gucci.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.40,1:00:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,三度烧伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Third Degree Burns{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.70,1:00:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害者照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Photograph of Victim{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.50,1:01:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查寻台 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Directory assistance. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.20,1:01:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要查询托卢卡郡立孤儿院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toluca County Orphanage, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.00,1:01:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,请稍后\N{\fnArial\fs30}One moment, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.90,1:01:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 我找到了相关信息 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I have that information for you. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.20,1:01:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉我地址吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you give me that address?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.20,1:01:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离避难所太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are wandering far from refuge here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.90,1:01:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没得选择了 带上她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's keep her with us. She's all we got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.10,1:02:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有111号房\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no room 111.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.90,1:02:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一场火\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first burning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.20,1:02:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么 安娜？- 第一场火\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it, Anna? - The first burning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.90,1:02:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时这小镇还没有名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the town had a name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.10,1:02:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,祖先们为了保持纯净\N{\fnArial\fs30}The elders of my elders kept us pure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.10,1:02:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小镇的祖先原来是巫女猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The founders of this town were witch-hunters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.90,1:02:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠烧死巫女来驱退黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burning the witch held back the darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.60,1:02:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好阻止世界末日「天启」的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It stopped the apocalypse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.20,1:02:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.20,1:02:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a room in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.80,1:03:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.40,1:03:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.60,1:03:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.40,1:03:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.80,1:03:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 到了另外一栋房子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. We're in the next building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.20,1:03:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么工厂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some factory, maybe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.00,1:03:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来这里曾起过火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like there was a fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.30,1:04:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.70,1:04:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.00,1:04:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.00,1:05:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕 我保证不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be scared. I promise I'm not gonna hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.60,1:05:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.20,1:05:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.70,1:05:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.60,1:05:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.40,1:06:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.30,1:06:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.80,1:06:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.20,1:06:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.10,1:06:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你简直就是她的双胞胎妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could be her twin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.40,1:06:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是阿蕾莎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Alessa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.10,1:06:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的莎伦在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my Sharon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.90,1:06:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.20,1:06:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在燃烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm burning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.00,1:06:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.40,1:06:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯 老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose? My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.40,1:06:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么过去的？- 她到哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you get over there? - Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.30,1:06:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab onto it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.10,1:07:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 荡回来 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now swing back around. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.50,1:07:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.30,1:07:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那边做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell were you doing over there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.20,1:07:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样会没命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get yourself killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.40,1:07:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚见到了达利亚的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I just saw Dahlia's daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.20,1:07:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她带我们到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the one that brought us here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.10,1:07:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.60,1:07:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她害我撞了车\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the one that made me crash my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.70,1:07:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿蕾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.10,1:07:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从不提这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't say her name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.10,1:07:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 这就是那个封印？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the seal, isn't it, Anna?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.60,1:07:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们信仰的标志？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The symbol of your faith?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.70,1:07:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里一定发生过很可怕的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something terrible happened here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.20,1:07:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,得走了 我们得走了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to leave. We have to leave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.60,1:07:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黑暗就要来了 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The darkness is coming! - Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.30,1:07:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.70,1:08:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,教堂并不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}The church isn't far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.10,1:08:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跑 快跑！- 罗斯 快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run. Run! - Rose, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.20,1:08:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.80,1:08:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.60,1:08:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.00,1:08:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快来！- 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come! - We gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.20,1:08:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗斯 快 - 我见过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rose, come on. - I've seen this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.60,1:09:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯 我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.40,1:09:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 西比尔！- 罗斯 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cybil! - Rose, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.00,1:09:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,西比尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cybil!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.10,1:09:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是躲避灾难 只是逃避内心的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You run not towards sanctuary but from your fears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.20,1:09:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要同流合污 他们是骗子 受诅咒的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not join the others. They are deceivers. They are damned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.20,1:09:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得进去 - 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta get inside. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.90,1:09:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是披着羊皮的狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are wolves in the skin of sheep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.40,1:09:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,自取灭亡 还要拖你陪葬\N{\fnArial\fs30}They brought about their own hell. They'll take you with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.70,1:09:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胡说八道！- 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Filth and lies! - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.20,1:09:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.90,1:09:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 我见过你女儿阿蕾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. I've seen your daughter. I've seen Alessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.00,1:09:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要来了！- 她死了是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's coming! - She's dead, isn't she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.80,1:09:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,烈火无法清洁 只会越烧越黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire doesn't cleanse, it blackens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.00,1:09:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听我说 - 罗斯 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen to me. - Rose, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.40,1:09:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和莎伦长得一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks exactly like Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.60,1:09:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她带我们来这儿的 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She brought us here, didn't she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.80,1:10:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？她到底要做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What does she want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.20,1:10:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔会随着仇恨一同苏醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil wakes in vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.10,1:10:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要小心做出选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful what you choose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.70,1:10:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.30,1:11:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.70,1:11:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巫女！- 她是恶魔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Witches! - She's evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.20,1:11:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让巫女靠近！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep away the witches!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.00,1:11:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 赶她们出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Send them back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.60,1:11:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.60,1:11:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们迷路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.30,1:11:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是神圣的避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a sanctuary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.90,1:12:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯贝拉 她们引诱了我的安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Christabella, they lured my Anna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.50,1:12:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,将她送到恶魔手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave her to the fiend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.30,1:12:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃莉诺 你一定记得 安娜没有依教规行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eleanor, you must remember that Anna went against our laws.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.10,1:12:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她独自外出 闯入恶魔的领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}She went alone outside into the devil's playground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.00,1:12:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不关这两个陌生人的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was not the responsibility of these two strangers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.30,1:12:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会儿再来对付她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll deal with them later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.40,1:12:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们要祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we must pray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.30,1:12:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I saw them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.70,1:12:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,从他们面前天地都逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}… from whose presence earth and heaven fled away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.60,1:13:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再无家可回\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no home was left to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.40,1:13:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I saw them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.70,1:13:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,从他们面前天地都逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}… from whose presence earth and heaven fled away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.10,1:13:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再无家可回\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no home was left to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.30,1:13:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又看见死了的人 无论大小\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I saw the dead, the great and the small…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.20,1:13:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,照他们所行的受审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and they were judged according to their deeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.60,1:13:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又看见死了的人 无论大小\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I saw the dead, the great and the small…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.90,1:13:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,照他们所行的受审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and they were judged according to their deeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.60,1:13:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,若有人名字没记在生命册上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And anyone's name not found written in the book of life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.20,1:13:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就被扔在火湖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}… they will be thrown into the lake of fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.20,1:13:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,托卢卡郡立孤儿院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toluca County Orphanage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.80,1:13:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我躺下睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I lay me down to sleep…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.90,1:13:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请主守护我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}… I pray the Lord my soul to keep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.00,1:13:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我醒来之前死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I should die before I wake…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.00,1:13:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,请主带我灵魂同行\N{\fnArial\fs30}… I pray the Lord my soul to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.40,1:14:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.70,1:14:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 孩子们 快上床睡觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, girls, into bed. Quickly, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.60,1:14:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,下雨天 也无处可去啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}No better place to be on a rainy night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.40,1:14:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳茜 快点 那位 拿好你的小熊 真乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}In you go, Lindsey, thattagirl. You've got your bear, that's a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.00,1:14:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,熄灯后不许讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No talking after lights are out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.10,1:14:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.30,1:14:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝保佑你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And God bless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.30,1:14:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 玛格丽特修女 真的等不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Sister Margaret, this really can't wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.70,1:14:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知什么这么急\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.40,1:14:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,9年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine years ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.40,1:14:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这所孤儿院外发现了一个女婴\N{\fnArial\fs30}… a baby was left outside this orphanage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.60,1:14:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和妻子领养了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife and I were the ones who adopted her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.90,1:14:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你感到高兴 达·西尔瓦先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very happy for you, Mr. Da Silva…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.90,1:14:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不能交出这里孩子的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}… but I can't give out information on our children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.30,1:14:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.00,1:14:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个女孩 和我女儿一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That girl, she looks exactly like my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.20,1:14:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮不了你 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help you, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.40,1:14:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很晚了 - 她该有40岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's late. - She must be 40 now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.30,1:14:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到哪能找到她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where can I find her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.30,1:15:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是她一个人的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This story isn't hers alone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.40,1:15:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而是关系到所有人！- 你这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- … but all of ours! - You people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.30,1:15:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是自找麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got yourself something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.70,1:15:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道什么麻烦么 克里斯？非法闯入？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what you got now, Chris? How about breaking and entering?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.90,1:15:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,照这个样子 还得加上伤害罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the looks of this, a little assault as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.70,1:15:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.60,1:15:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能再追究下去了 - 不会的 修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This can't go any farther. - It won't, Sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.70,1:15:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识一些12岁的小毛孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I have some 12-year-olds…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.10,1:15:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,都比你会掩饰行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}… who cover their tracks better than you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.80,1:15:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.30,1:15:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,古奇 认得她么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Gucci, do you know her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.10,1:15:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是我女儿的亲生母亲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that my daughter's birth mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.80,1:15:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 转过身去 - 你要做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, turn around. - What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.30,1:15:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我认识那女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that girl. I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.50,1:15:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说她没能熬过那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told she didn't make it through the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.50,1:15:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,起火的那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night of the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.70,1:15:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,寂静岭烧起大火那一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night of the big fire in Silent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.10,1:15:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were these people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.40,1:15:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,狂热的教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}… these fanatics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.80,1:16:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,残忍地虐待了那个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What they did to that child was terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.30,1:16:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是30年前的事了 早已过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was 30 years ago, and it's over now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.50,1:16:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 并没有过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not as far as I'm concerned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.80,1:16:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎么样 城里人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it gonna be, city boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.00,1:16:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以送你进监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can put you in jail…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.70,1:16:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你可以回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}… or you can go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.00,1:16:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你所谓的正义？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's your definition of justice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.90,1:16:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,正义的形式有很多种 克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many different forms of justice, Chris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.30,1:16:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的 上帝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, you've got man's, God's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.40,1:16:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至恶魔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and even the devil's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.70,1:16:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底哪一种 不由你说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certain forms you just can't control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.40,1:16:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你马上回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I want you to go home now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.00,1:16:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺倒温暖的床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}… to your nice warm bed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.50,1:16:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来对付这个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and let me deal with this town…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.10,1:16:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,和过去30年里的变故.\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and what has happened over the last 30 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.00,1:16:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了？故事结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? End of story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.10,1:16:59.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（全能的主啊 在他手里…）
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.20,1:17:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,先告诉我你们怎么来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me first how you got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.70,1:17:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我不知道怎么到这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I don't know how I got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.40,1:17:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我丢了小女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, I've lost my little girl…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.50,1:17:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我明白必须要到这教堂来\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and all I know is that I'm supposed to be in this church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.30,1:17:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有信仰么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a person of faith?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.60,1:17:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱我女儿 - 没问你这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love my daughter. - That's not what I asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.20,1:17:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭什么由你来决断？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you to judge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.60,1:17:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就凭昔日的灵魂还未安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We judge because the souls of history hang in the balance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.00,1:17:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而信仰从未让我们失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because our faith has never failed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.80,1:17:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是信仰让地狱的黑暗无法蔓延\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our faith keeps the darkness of hell at bay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.40,1:17:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就用你们的信仰 帮我找到女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then use your faith to help me find my little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.70,1:17:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有恶魔知道她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the demon knows where she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.90,1:17:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那告诉我 到哪去找这个恶魔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then tell me, where do I find this demon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.00,1:17:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能从黑暗力量中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one has ever returned from the core of the darkness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.70,1:17:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔藏身之处逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}… where the demon lies in wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.30,1:17:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会帮忙的 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not gonna help us. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.90,1:17:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是愿意面对恶魔 找到女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wish to face the demon to find your daughter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.70,1:17:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}… I won't stop you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.10,1:17:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克里斯贝拉 不能去那下面 - 闭嘴 亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Christabella, they can't go down… - Silence, Adam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.50,1:17:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你的信仰能保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps your faith will protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.60,1:17:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.50,1:18:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你不想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't wanna do this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.80,1:18:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}… I'll understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.00,1:18:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦是领养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon's adopted…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.90,1:18:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我是她母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}… but I'm her mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.30,1:18:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,从见到她的第一眼起 我就这样认定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that from the moment I first laid eyes on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.70,1:18:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真幸运 有你这样的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's lucky to have you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.00,1:18:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在孩子眼里 母亲就是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother is God in the eyes of a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.60,1:19:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.40,1:19:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在在他的领地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in his domain now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.40,1:19:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个地图 记下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this map. Memorize it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.70,1:20:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的记忆能救你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your memory may save your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.20,1:20:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到这个房间了？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you see this room? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.40,1:20:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔就在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is where the darkness lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.30,1:20:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔在这栋楼的中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon is in the bowels of this building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.90,1:20:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在一张天真无邪的面孔下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hides behind the face of an innocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.40,1:20:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean a child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.90,1:20:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要相信你的眼睛 它们在欺骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't believe your eyes. Your eyes will lie to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.40,1:20:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,信仰才是唯一的真理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faith is the only truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.50,1:20:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为你祈祷 罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will pray for you, Rose…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.90,1:20:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过并不期待你和伙伴 能活着出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}… but I won't expect you and your friend to return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.10,1:20:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.10,1:20:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.60,1:20:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,左 右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.80,1:20:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,左 左\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left. Left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.40,1:20:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 右 右 左 - 带他们到下一层\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. Right. Left. - Take them to the lower level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.50,1:20:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 底层？- 照着做 然后回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the basement? - Do it, then return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.50,1:20:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 左 3A - 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Left. 3A. - But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.10,1:20:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 右 4A - 我说了 照做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. 4A. - I said, do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.50,1:20:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 左 左 右 - 罗斯罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Left. Left. Right. - Rose. Rose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.50,1:21:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 左 右 左 左 - 罗斯 她要害死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Left. Right. Left. Left. - Rose, she's killing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.20,1:21:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗斯！- 让我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rose! - Let me do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.60,1:21:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.70,1:21:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.50,1:21:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,光会吸引他们 但没有光你什么也看不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be drawn to the light, but you won't be able to see without it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.20,1:21:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.30,1:21:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样真的可以？- 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So this thing actually works? - It will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.30,1:21:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果恶魔需要你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the demon wants you, it will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.50,1:21:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请饶恕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.10,1:21:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们终日拾荒已成习惯 我想这是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lived too long as scavengers. I believe this is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.40,1:22:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫女！她女儿和阿蕾莎一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witch! Her child's the likeness of Alessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.30,1:22:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她女儿就是孽种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her child's the next vessel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.80,1:22:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止她！不要让巫女下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop her! Don't let the witches go down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.50,1:22:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.60,1:22:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,离她远点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.10,1:22:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.10,1:22:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！等等！西比尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Wait! Cybil!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.00,1:22:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,西比尔！开门！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cybil! Open the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.00,1:23:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.30,1:24:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,8A\N{\fnArial\fs30}8A.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.40,1:24:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,7A 右拐\N{\fnArial\fs30}7A. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.80,1:24:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,右拐 6A\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. 6A.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.50,1:24:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,4A\N{\fnArial\fs30}4A.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.40,1:24:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,3A\N{\fnArial\fs30}3A.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.90,1:25:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,左 左 右 右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left, left. Right, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.90,1:25:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,左 左\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left, left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.60,1:26:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.60,1:27:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, Rose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.70,1:27:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.90,1:27:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.20,1:27:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相就是你的奖励\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your reward is the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.30,1:27:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有看到小阿蕾莎多乖啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that Alessa was a good little girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.10,1:27:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管没有人这样认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though nobody looked at her that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.40,1:28:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 烧死这巫女！烧死她！- 她们的父母说她很坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Burn the witch! Burn the witch! - Their parents told them she was bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.90,1:28:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像别人 她没有父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't have a father like they did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.50,1:28:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿蕾莎一个人好孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alessa was alone in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.90,1:28:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道当小女孩一个人 会出什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what can happen to little girls when they're left alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.60,1:28:30.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（柯林）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.30,1:28:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, it's me, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.60,1:28:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,连她的妈妈也没有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even her mother couldn't help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.30,1:28:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管她深爱自己的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though she loved her baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.20,1:28:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里人都不爱阿蕾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the rest of the family didn't love Alessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.30,1:28:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,同那些人一样 令她感到害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were just like the others and made her scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.80,1:28:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,连小孩都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know. Even the children know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.90,1:28:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your daughter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.70,1:28:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么就不说出父亲的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you won't just name the father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.50,1:29:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给大家带来了罪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've brought sin amongst us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.30,1:29:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要集合众信徒进行审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}The faithful must gather in judgment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.50,1:29:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好清洗这不洁之事\N{\fnArial\fs30}… for we are called to purify this filth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.80,1:29:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 她说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does she mean, Mommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.20,1:29:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太软弱 亲爱的妹妹 总是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're weak, my dear sister. You always were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.70,1:29:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我们 达利亚 相信大家的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust us, Dahlia. Have faith in our virtue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.40,1:29:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会恢复清白\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will restore innocence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.60,1:29:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,建镇至今 集会过很多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had met many times since the town was built…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.00,1:29:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了所谓的恢复清白和纯洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}… to restore innocence and purity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.20,1:29:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个专门地方做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had a special place for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.90,1:29:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,记不记得那个饭店？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember the hotel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.90,1:29:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你去过所有的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I led you to all these places…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.90,1:29:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都很好地跟随了我的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and you were very good at following my clues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.10,1:29:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以走了 达利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may leave, Dahlia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.10,1:29:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要斗的不是罪人 而是罪恶本身\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fight the sin, not the sinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.50,1:30:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪！妈咪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy! Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.50,1:30:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.20,1:30:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯 你能体会这种感受吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how that feels, don't you, Rose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.10,1:30:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去自己的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}To lose your little girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.20,1:30:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have I done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.80,1:30:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 不必为恶魔哭泣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God. - Weep not for the demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.60,1:30:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.10,1:30:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一次 我们面对生死存亡的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once again we are locked in mortal battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.50,1:30:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为自己知道如何驱魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They thought they knew how to cast out evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.20,1:30:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赞颂上帝赐我们清明 - 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Praise God for our clarity. - Amen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.20,1:30:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,赞颂清白之人所做的牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise the innocent for their sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.60,1:30:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过要和恶魔战斗 可得小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you should be careful how you fight evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.80,1:30:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还我们以洁净 - 洁净\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They give us back our purity. - Purity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.00,1:30:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有团结 - 团结\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And our unity. - Unity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.10,1:30:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手里的武器 可能会反过来要你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your weapons can turn back on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.30,1:31:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.40,1:31:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.90,1:31:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你明白 为何达利亚会心碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you know why Dahlia is broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.60,1:31:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她试着找人帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}She tried to get help…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.20,1:31:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}… but she went too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.70,1:31:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,架住她 快架住她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her up, boys. Get her up now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.30,1:31:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇上也有好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were good people in the town…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.80,1:31:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一样的好人 罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}… people like you, Rose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.20,1:31:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们施以援手\N{\fnArial\fs30}People who like to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.40,1:31:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿蕾莎好孤单 又痛苦又害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alessa was so lonely and hurt and scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.30,1:31:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不该这样伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should have known better than to hurt her so badly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.40,1:32:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你被病痛和恐惧折磨太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're hurt and scared for so long…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.90,1:32:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们便会统统化作仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}… your fear and pain turn to hate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.60,1:32:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这种仇恨 开始改变周围的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and the hate starts to change the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.50,1:32:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿蕾莎的仇恨与日俱增 在她体内燃烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alessa's hate grew and grew, burning inside her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.70,1:32:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,恨意是那么强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her hate got so strong…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.00,1:32:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连仅仅是好奇的人都不放过\N{\fnArial\fs30}… she even hurt someone who was only curious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.00,1:32:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个时候我出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when I came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.30,1:32:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉她报复的时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her it was their turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.20,1:33:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证他们都会落入她的噩梦中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised they would all fall into her darkest dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.60,1:33:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 罗斯 我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Rose, we must talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.00,1:34:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.60,1:34:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.20,1:34:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.60,1:34:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.80,1:34:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿蕾莎 - 那你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She is Alessa. - Then who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.40,1:34:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很多名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have many names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.90,1:34:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我是阿蕾莎的黑暗面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, I'm the dark part of Alessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.10,1:34:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我孩子在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.00,1:35:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是你孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not your child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.10,1:35:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's hers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.50,1:35:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她用仅存的善良 幻化出那个小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little girl is what's left of her goodness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.50,1:35:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把她安全地藏好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hid her in safety…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.20,1:35:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放到这炼狱以外的世界里\N{\fnArial\fs30}… in the world outside this hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.60,1:35:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,托卢卡郡立孤儿院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toluca County Orphanage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.40,1:35:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 她一生的噩梦该结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the dream of this life must end…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.90,1:35:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而梦里的人 也该做个了断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and so, too, must the dreamers within it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.00,1:35:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,30多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For over 30 years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.50,1:35:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一直欺骗自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}… they've lied to their own souls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.80,1:35:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,30年来始终否认自己的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}For 30 years they've denied their own fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.20,1:35:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日即将来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now is the end of days…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.60,1:35:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收获的时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and I am the reaper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.90,1:35:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.90,1:35:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要的只是满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we ask for is satisfaction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.90,1:36:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,满足？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satisfaction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.20,1:36:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.90,1:36:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么选我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.10,1:36:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己做的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.50,1:36:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选择了莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.00,1:36:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯贝拉会找到莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christabella will find Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.50,1:36:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会计划「清洁」她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She plans to purify her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.60,1:36:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.20,1:36:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们盲目的信念将我拦在教堂外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their blind conviction repels me from their church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.40,1:36:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他们不认命 我就进不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot enter while they deny their fate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.70,1:36:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}… but you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.00,1:36:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我该怎么做 - 说出真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just tell me what I need to do. - Tell them the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.70,1:37:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子是我的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The child is mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.80,1:37:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.30,1:38:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.00,1:38:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.80,1:38:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在目明之人面前 真相无比清晰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is clear to those who see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.20,1:38:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一如我当初看出你怀了孽种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as I could see you had this child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.60,1:38:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.80,1:38:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车 转过身去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the car. Turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.00,1:39:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个善意的警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a friendly warning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.50,1:39:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带着明事理的人回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}… I'll be back with people who know what they're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.80,1:39:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这之前 我想跟你谈谈伯纳特警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you do that, Chris, I wanna tell you about Officer Bennett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.20,1:39:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前 一个疯子拐了个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Few years back, some wacko, he abducted a kid…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.40,1:39:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他扔到寂静岭 一个矿井通风口里\N{\fnArial\fs30}… threw him down a mine vent up there in Silent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.90,1:39:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,西比尔·伯纳特找到那个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cybil Bennett, she found that boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.40,1:39:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,整整三天 她都抱着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She spent three days holding onto him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.30,1:39:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持他的生命 直至获救\N{\fnArial\fs30}… keeping him alive until they were rescued.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.70,1:39:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自有分寸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know what we're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.30,1:39:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也得尽我全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to do everything I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.30,1:39:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.80,1:40:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 克里斯贝拉 放她条生路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Christabella, let her live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.20,1:40:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的软弱令这些灵魂受到审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your weakness led these souls to judgment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.60,1:40:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这回你活该目睹这一切发生 - 她是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This time you will bear witness. - She is innocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.10,1:40:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看她 你女儿的孽种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at her. She's the whelp of your daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.30,1:40:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.00,1:40:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔利用她的孩子孕育罪恶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon fathered this disgusting abomination from her child!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.50,1:40:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她是我的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.70,1:40:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦 莎伦 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon. Sharon, look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.90,1:40:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 别害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. Don't be afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.70,1:40:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 你妈妈马上就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, it's okay. Your mama's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.00,1:40:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一次 我们为了恢复清白 聚到一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once again we are called upon to restore innocence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.90,1:40:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死这巫女 征服邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}We burn this witch. We vanquish evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.70,1:40:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你们不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You can't. You can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.00,1:40:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 别任她瞎说！- 烧死这孽种！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't let her say this! No! - We burn the child!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.90,1:40:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,战胜恶魔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fight the demon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.10,1:40:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是个孩子啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just a child!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.50,1:40:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们他妈的是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is wrong with you people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.90,1:41:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.30,1:41:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许碰她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave her alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.70,1:41:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许碰她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave her alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.10,1:41:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,助纣为虐者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who aid the demon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.20,1:41:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也要接受地狱之火的净化！\N{\fnArial\fs30}… they must be cleansed by the fire from whence they came!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.20,1:41:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯了 你们都疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's crazy. You're crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.50,1:41:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.90,1:41:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么都相信她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you listening to this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.70,1:41:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.80,1:41:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死巫女！烧死她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn the witch! Burn her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.00,1:41:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死巫女！烧死她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn the witch! Burn her! Burn the witch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.10,1:41:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.20,1:41:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶的巫女！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil witch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.10,1:41:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,受罪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suffer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.60,1:42:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死巫女！烧死她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn the witch! Burn her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.40,1:42:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死巫女！烧死她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn the witch! Burn her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.60,1:42:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.20,1:42:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死巫女！烧死她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn the witch! Burn her! Burn the witch! Burn her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.50,1:42:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死巫女！烧死她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn the witch! Burn her! Burn the witch! Burn her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.80,1:42:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.80,1:42:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们自作孽 必下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in your own hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.30,1:42:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈啊 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama, be with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.40,1:43:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,天启就此开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is where the apocalypse began.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.50,1:43:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对世界的毁灭已经结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where we stopped the annihilation of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.50,1:43:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地上 我们划出界限\N{\fnArial\fs30}We drew a line in the sand and said:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.30,1:43:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说：「恶魔 你无法越过！」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Demon, you will not cross!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.90,1:43:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是恶魔叛逆而阴险\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the demon is wicked, full of treachery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.80,1:43:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一次带上无辜的面具来诱惑我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet again he comes to tempt us in the guise of an innocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.10,1:43:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要铲除恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}To rid the world of this demon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.30,1:43:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要烧死这孩子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}… we must burn this child!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.80,1:43:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会得逞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna happen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.80,1:43:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.90,1:43:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, baby. Everything's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.50,1:43:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.40,1:43:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.70,1:43:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都做了些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you people done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.10,1:43:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你回来了 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have returned. - Yes, I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.00,1:44:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫女回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The witch has returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.90,1:44:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别信她的鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not believe her lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.00,1:44:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从外面的世界来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come from a world outside this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.40,1:44:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,从一个生机勃勃的世界来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come from a world full of life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.70,1:44:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不告诉他们真相？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you tell them the truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.40,1:44:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个连你自己都否认的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them the truth that you deny, even to yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.00,1:44:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有天启！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no apocalypse!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.40,1:44:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们活在自己制造的炼狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You burned in the fire that you started…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.70,1:44:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,无可救赎 因为你们都被诅咒了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and nothing can save you because you're already damned!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.80,1:44:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈咪！- 把她抓起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mommy! - Take her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.50,1:44:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧！把她当巫女烧死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn her! Burn her as a witch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.50,1:44:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn her! Burn her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.50,1:44:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫女！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon witch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.00,1:44:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 烧死我？- 巫女\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Burn me? - Demon witch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.80,1:44:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的对策？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your answer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.30,1:44:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死你所惧怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn anything you're afraid of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.50,1:44:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧光不受你控制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn anything you can't control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.90,1:44:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这女人 利用你们的恐惧来控制你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This woman uses your fear to control you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.50,1:44:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她指使你们烧阿蕾莎·格雷斯彼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She led you to burn Alessa Gillespie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.30,1:45:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她指使你们烧一个无辜的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She led you to burn an innocent child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.30,1:45:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们无法否认你们的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will not deny your guilt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.70,1:45:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法否认她的痛苦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and you cannot deny her pain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.50,1:45:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个孩子是罪恶的化身\N{\fnArial\fs30}That child was sin incarnate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.10,1:45:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你才犯下罪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's you who have sinned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.90,1:45:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去你丑化一颗无辜的心灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You darkened the heart of an innocent…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.20,1:45:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又惧怕阿蕾莎的复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and now you cower in the face of Alessa's revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.20,1:45:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sinner. Heresy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.40,1:45:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死她！烧死她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn her! Burn her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.80,1:45:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的信仰将带来灭顶之灾！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your faith brings death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.20,1:45:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在地狱门口 孤立无助\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are alone in this limbo…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.30,1:45:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为上帝不在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and God is not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.50,1:45:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.90,1:45:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是亵渎者！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a blasphemer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.80,1:46:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,亵渎者！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blasphemer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.20,1:46:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,亵渎者！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blasphemer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.60,1:47:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.30,1:47:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把黑暗带了进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've brought the darkness in with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.30,1:47:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道你做了什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what you've done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.50,1:47:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了莎伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.10,1:47:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.00,1:47:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy. Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.40,1:49:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.90,1:49:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,主啊 请助我保持纯净！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lord, give me the strength to stay pure!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.10,1:50:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.70,1:50:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿蕾莎 你都做了些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alessa, what have you become?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.90,1:51:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.00,1:51:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎伦！宝贝 妈妈来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharon! Sharon, honey, it's me. It's Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.70,1:51:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来了 我们下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down. We're getting down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.20,1:51:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上眼 乖 闭上眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your eyes. Shut your eyes, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.70,1:51:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上眼 快闭上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your eyes. Shut your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.30,1:51:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上眼 快闭上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your eyes. Shut your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.70,1:51:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个噩梦 噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a bad dream. It's just a bad dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.80,1:52:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么她不要我的命？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did she not take me with the others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.20,1:52:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是他母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're her mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.20,1:52:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在孩子眼里 母亲就是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother is God in the eyes of a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.30,1:53:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.30,1:54:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 我是克里斯 - 我是罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, this is Chris. - And this is Rose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.80,1:54:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是莎伦·达·西尔瓦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm Sharon Da Silva.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.80,1:54:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,请留言！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please leave a message!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.10,1:54:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christopher, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.30,1:54:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和莎伦在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.70,1:54:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？喂？罗斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello? Rose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.50,1:54:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.20,1:55:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们这就回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We're coming home.{\r}
